  ║    [5] link4/5/6 masses too low for 10kg payload -> corrected          ║
  ║    [6] joint4/5/6 effort too low to hold 10kg   -> corrected           ║
  ║    [7] top_camera rpy=(0,pi/2,0) = sideways     -> fixed to (0,pi/2,pi)║
  ║    [8] base_link cylinder inertia formula       -> corrected           ║
